Project Overview
You are building the frontend for MediConnect, a comprehensive rural healthcare platform designed for rural India. The application serves two user roles: Patients and Doctors, with a focus on accessibility features like multi-language support (English, Hindi, Telugu), voice commands, and text-to-speech for users with limited literacy.

Technology Stack
Framework: React 19 with Vite
Styling: Tailwind CSS v3 with custom design system
State Management: Zustand
Data Fetching: TanStack Query (React Query v5)
Routing: React Router DOM v6
Authentication: Firebase Phone Auth (OTP-based)
Internationalization: i18next with react-i18next
Forms: React Hook Form with Zod validation
Icons: Lucide React
Notifications: React Hot Toast
Date Handling: date-fns
Voice Features: Web Speech API (SpeechRecognition & SpeechSynthesis)
Video Consultation: Jitsi Meet (free, no API key required)
